sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant W as Web
    participant A as API
    participant D as DB
    U->>+W: open dashboard
    W->>+A: GET /me
    A-->>-W: 401 expired
    Note right of W: refresh the token
    alt token refreshed
        W->>A: POST /refresh
        A-->>W: new token
    else refresh failed
        W-xU: back to login
    end
    loop every 30s
        W-)A: heartbeat
    end
    A->>A: audit log
    A->D: write audit row
    W-->>-U: dashboard
